WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.500
Yuria.

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:07.470
Defiled, and dressed in rags..you might not
mark her as a witch if not for that iconic,

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:08.550
pointed hat.

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:13.190
Legends attest that witches have been wearing
this peculiar style of headwear since long

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:18.330
ago..which implies that "magic women".. were
common back then.

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.840
Tour the nexus, and you will find a plethora
of statues depicting women; wrapped in robes,

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:26.039
masked by hoods.

00:00:26.039 --> 00:00:31.039
Befriend the monumental, and she reveals that
she too is female.

00:00:31.039 --> 00:00:35.810
For in Demon's Souls, women have a unique
capacity for the Soul Arts.

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:43.990
For them, sorcery is commonly an art of emotion..intuited
from feeling, rather than developed through

00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:44.990
contemplation.

00:00:44.990 --> 00:00:45.990
For witches, sorcery is an art of emotion..intuited
from feeling,

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:50.320
Freke wields a different kind of magic from
my witchcraft.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:56.140
Freke's magic stems from an understanding
of the essence of the Demon soul,

00:00:56.140 --> 00:01:00.719
while my witchcraft merely channels its energy.

00:01:00.719 --> 00:01:06.090
If the Demon is cursed, so shall be the witchcraft.

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:13.100
Freke's power comes from human potential,
while mine is a dark, dependent art.

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:19.410
So when you find a Demon Soul, you take it
to Yuria to manifest its power..not Freke.

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:24.950
I feel great misgivings about Freke.

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:29.640
I was branded a witch at a very young age,
and since then, I have been persecuted as

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:31.170
a threat to human society.

00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:38.170
Although I never had ill-intentions, this
black craft of mine is intrinsically evil.

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:45.619
If there is a God, he gave us souls to do
good, not to practice witchcraft.

00:01:45.619 --> 00:01:52.940
My accusers detested my dark arts for good
reason, for the path I have taken is tainted.

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:55.030
This has been one of my realizations since
coming to Boletaria.

00:01:55.030 --> 00:02:00.210
But I am afraid that Freke, too, has ventured
down the wrong path.

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:02.870
He has become obsessed with the dark arts.

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:03.870
Her sorcery differs from mine, rather they
are arts of emotion and feel closer to miracles.

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:04.870
Perhaps it’s because she’s a woman…?

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:05.870
Is having it all beyond my grasp…?

00:02:05.870 --> 00:02:06.870
- Japanese Dialogue w/ english subtitles

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:10.289
The Dark Arts, and Witches, have such an evil
reputation..because here in this nexus, years

00:02:10.289 --> 00:02:14.250
ago..women did what men could not.

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:21.599
Here, their unique proficiency for Soul Magic
was used to its fullest potential..to worship,

00:02:21.599 --> 00:02:25.490
study..and eventually awaken the Old One.

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:27.800
This led to the first scourge.

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:31.800
To demons, and to the defilement of half the
world.

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:37.050
If there was any one member responsible for
awakening The Old One, then it was the Maiden

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:38.480
in Black.

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:43.510
This witch demonstrates a motherly tenderness
with the demon, and was one of its most powerful

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:45.540
servants during this time.

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:50.330
Like other witches, she would have channeled
its power..and the power of the Old One was

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:52.160
dark indeed.

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:57.530
It absorbs souls - claiming them through a
network of demons in the fog.

00:02:57.530 --> 00:02:58.530
Countless would end up displaced fleeing the
ever-creeping and all-consuming fog, exacerbating

00:02:58.530 --> 00:02:59.530
the number of impoverished refugees.

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:00.530
Busy with the war, no nation accepted these
poor men and women, forcing them all to wander

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:01.530
the earth, with only the sympathetic clergy,
spiritual healers, and witch doctors to guide

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:02.530
them onward.

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:04.800
Skewered with spears likely dropped from the
nexus, the Old One appeared unkillable.

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:12.160
So with countless souls lost, the fabric of
reality broken, and kingdoms reduced to ruin..the

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:15.819
Monumentals settled for a half measure.

00:03:15.819 --> 00:03:21.190
They forced the Old One into slumber, imprisoned
it in their temple, and took it to the far

00:03:21.190 --> 00:03:27.379
reaches of human habitation, where they hoped
the beast might never be disturbed again.

00:03:27.379 --> 00:03:33.620
The Maiden, defiled, and dressed in black..was
blinded with wax, and forced to tend to the

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:35.930
candles within the shrine.

00:03:35.930 --> 00:03:42.489
She is the shame of the monumentals, a disastrous
product of their culture's obsession with

00:03:42.489 --> 00:03:43.489
magic.

00:03:43.489 --> 00:03:44.489
dressed in black..was defiled.

00:03:44.489 --> 00:03:47.129
The monumentals punished her, blinding the
immortal with wax, and forcing her to tend

00:03:47.129 --> 00:03:48.940
to the candles within the shrine.

00:03:48.940 --> 00:03:52.599
She is their shame, a product of their culture’s
obsession with magic

00:03:52.599 --> 00:03:53.910
The monumentals have punished the Maiden in
Black severely, blinding the shacked immortal

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:59.010
with wax, and . And because of this arrogance,
their entire civilization was destroyed along

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:01.129
with much of the world.

00:04:01.129 --> 00:04:07.000
To repair the fabric of reality, six archstones
were constructed and given to the remaining

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:08.540
leaders of men.

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:10.180
The ambitious king saddled atop a tiny nation..

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:11.540
The digger king whose people mined the underground..

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:12.540
The intelligent queen holding the keys to
the ivory tower..The priest to shadowmen glorifying

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:13.540
death and storms..

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:14.540
The giants that lay claim to the north.

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:15.540
And, yes, even the chief of those wandering
poor.

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:16.750
The ambitious king..the digger king..the intelligent
queen..the priest to the shadowmen, the giants..and

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:20.989
yes, even to the chief of those wandering
poor.

00:04:20.989 --> 00:04:27.780
Starved of magic during this period, many
of these cultures collapsed.

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:33.720
With no magic arts to heal them, and no nation
welcoming the poor, the chief of the wandering

00:04:33.720 --> 00:04:38.790
poor led his vagrants deep into the western
valley, where no one would mind their poverty.

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:39.870
This place?

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:42.830
It's a proper mound of rubbish.

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:46.550
All the rot of the world, living or not, ends
up here.

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:48.310
Here, anarchy reigns.

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:56.419
The poor scavenge for food, shelter, and wares..diseased
vermin bite and suck their soiled skin..merchants

00:04:56.419 --> 00:04:59.330
lie and cheat, and a cannibal roams the swamp.

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:04.530
It should come as no surprise then, that the
Chief's duty to their archstone was quickly

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:05.660
forgotten.

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:10.920
Why should they care about the outside world,
when it had all but abandoned them?

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:15.860
To make matters worse.. above, a new religion
was gaining power..

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:22.000
A priesthood from the land of Mird, whose
temples quickly came to span the continent,

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.440
especially in the Western Highlands.

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:30.770
They had a belief in a singular deity - a
God who seeks all that is pure and good, and

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:35.160
rejects all that is impure and evil.

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:41.199
As a result, we see higher-ranking priests
achieve saintly status by remaining pure in

00:05:41.199 --> 00:05:47.340
every sense - sequestering themselves in their
temples, devoted to prayer, reciting miracles

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:53.530
that reject death, selfishness, disease, poison..but
most reviled of all: was magic.

00:05:53.530 --> 00:05:54.530
But most of all..the priesthood reviled magic.

00:05:54.530 --> 00:05:59.720
It was those evil sorcerers and magicians
that caused a near-apocalypse, so the priests’

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:04.710
anti-magic stance made it ripe for popularity.

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:10.490
They built upon the Monumentals' ban on such
power, taking steps to oppress any who practice

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:14.530
the craft..regardless of intention or circumstance.

00:06:14.530 --> 00:06:16.260
Yuria serves as our foremost example.

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:17.700
Yet..witches like Yuria still cling to their
black arts, finding their talents to be their

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:18.700
one solace against their persecutors.

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:23.010
Now..while the Soul Arts are a distant memory
at this point in history..artifacts from this

00:06:23.010 --> 00:06:25.759
bygone age still exist.

00:06:25.759 --> 00:06:30.380
Take the Ring of Magical Nature, for example
- cursed witches were believed to be born

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:37.580
holding this ring..making artifacts like these
objects of extreme fear..and superstition.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:39.949
Unless the church found them, of course.

00:06:39.949 --> 00:06:43.139
Then, they were considered divine revelations
instead.

00:06:43.139 --> 00:06:44.139
How convenient.

00:06:44.139 --> 00:06:47.620
There was the Moonlight Sword, granted to
Temple Knight Vizo.

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:51.500
The Istarelle, given to temple knight Rizaia.

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:57.090
Blind, given to Selen Vinland..and Bramd,
taken up by her brother Garl.

00:06:57.090 --> 00:07:02.349
But perhaps most special of all..was the Ring
of Sincere Prayer.

00:07:02.349 --> 00:07:07.169
An artifact found by a truly lucky (Source:
Blueblood Sword) young girl..leading to her

00:07:07.169 --> 00:07:09.240
instant rise as the Sixth Saint.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:10.240
Astraea.

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.552
(note: The Japanese specifically elevates
holy women, as opposed to the more common

00:07:12.552 --> 00:07:13.552
"saint" urbain)

00:07:13.552 --> 00:07:14.552
So is she a saint..or a witch?

00:07:14.552 --> 00:07:15.552
Well..she's both, in a way.

00:07:15.552 --> 00:07:16.552
For they are one and the same.

00:07:16.552 --> 00:07:20.130
It's here, that we arrive at the biggest twist
Demon's Souls has to offer.

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:26.241
That magic and miracles are two sides of the
same coin..and that the Old One is at the

00:07:26.241 --> 00:07:27.241
heart of it all.

00:07:27.241 --> 00:07:28.241
Prayer is for the foolish, quaint, and soon-to-be
dead.

00:07:28.241 --> 00:07:29.241
And heaven forbid the day you find out what
their so-called God really is…

00:07:29.241 --> 00:07:33.319
Why else would all their most powerful saints
be women?

00:07:33.319 --> 00:07:38.930
Why else were miracles energized alongside
magic when the Old One was awakened?

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:43.639
Why do the priests talismans of god..resemble
the Old One?

00:07:43.639 --> 00:07:45.100
It's simple.

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:48.070
Because their so-called God..is the old one.

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:54.190
His miracles..are the Soul Arts..and women
can more easily channel this magic..whether

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:56.270
they be witches..or saints.

00:07:56.270 --> 00:08:03.710
With the loss of history, later generations
found certain magic indistinguishable from

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:08.349
their conception of divine power, associating
anything somehow unclean with malice.

00:08:08.349 --> 00:08:14.789
The temple believes whatever best suits their
politics..so when they cast their arrogant

00:08:14.789 --> 00:08:20.540
gaze towards the denizens of the valley, they
didn't see the needy..they saw sinners being

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:22.289
punished by god.

00:08:22.289 --> 00:08:25.040
However, this couldn't be farther from the
truth.

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:27.930
I find something odd about this place.

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:34.890
It brims with grime, but at once feels strangely
pure.

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:38.940
The lost and unclean are simply victims of
circumstance.

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:43.260
Circumstances that the temple created, when
they abandoned them.

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:48.790
Circumstances that Astraea, the Sixth Saint..set
out to resolve.

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:53.050
During the early years of the Second Scourge,
the Sixth Saintess was quick to embark on

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:59.010
a relief mission to Boletaria.. and in the
years after entering the tear, she discovered

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:03.830
the existence of the valley.

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:07.950
That witch Astraea came to this valley with
that squid-headed knight.

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:10.940
Those ridiculous white robes of hers…

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:14.180
I swear I caught her glaring at my son in
disgust!

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:17.610
Yes, yes it's true!

00:09:17.610 --> 00:09:24.630
For a woman whose luck saved her from both
poverty and plague, seeing the poor and afflicted

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:29.070
came as a shock, which the filthy woman misinterpreted
as contempt.

00:09:29.070 --> 00:09:38.740
In truth, the clergywoman’s heart ached
for their suffering.

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:45.510
And she began to question for the first time:
Why had God permitted their pain?

00:09:45.510 --> 00:09:49.860
If there is natural evil, it is not those
forced to live in the valley.

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:54.980
It is God, so cruel and unjust to allow suffering
in His Creation.

00:09:54.980 --> 00:10:00.480
And so, Astraea chose to bring salvation to
these people abandoned like the trash of the

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:01.480
valley.

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:04.160
But healing magic can only go so far.

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:07.130
In order to reach the root of the problem,
the former Sixth Saintess needed to take away

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:10.850
the source of thoughts which bring pain: the
soul.

00:10:10.850 --> 00:10:16.320
And so, she became an Archdemon for the Old
One, gaining the power to rob the living of

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:17.500
their souls.

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:22.650
She embraced the filthy, ridding them of their
suffering..and for that, they revere her.

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:25.031
All the men worship her like she's the Virgin
Mary.

00:10:25.031 --> 00:10:27.950
The same men who would snatch my child away
from me!

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:28.950
This was a much better place before she came.

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:29.950
I was the apple of every mans eye.

00:10:29.950 --> 00:10:30.950
You’re here to rid us of her, aren't you?

00:10:30.950 --> 00:10:31.950
Well, don't show her any mercy!

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:35.730
Astraea sits on a mountain of gold and corpses:
offerings from the men of the Valley, desperate

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:38.820
to repay their debt to the woman who loved
them.

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:44.050
Any soul will do - making it a terrifying
place for people like the Filthy Woman..and

00:10:44.050 --> 00:10:47.000
the temple knights who embarked in pilgrimage
here.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:51.420
Have you heard the rumours about Astraea of
the Valley of Defilement?

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:57.230
They claim that she and her loyal knight have
become Demons, and lead a clan of degenerate

00:10:57.230 --> 00:10:58.230
miscreants.

00:10:58.230 --> 00:11:00.640
In truth, the rumours are surely unfounded.

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:05.839
There are all sorts of wrongdoers down there
who would think up such nonsense.

00:11:05.839 --> 00:11:09.640
…Yet if the rumours are true…

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:14.390
Then may she be eternally *****ed for her
debasement of the Lord's name!

00:11:14.390 --> 00:11:20.830
By this point, her bodyguard Garl Vinland
should have stepped in and purified her for

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:32.190
her sacrilege, but it was no use.

00:11:32.190 --> 00:11:41.190
He had seen the same things as she, and the
young noble knight bravely stood in solidarity

00:11:41.190 --> 00:11:42.190
with her decision.

00:11:42.190 --> 00:11:46.790
How dare you persist in intruding upon our
haven.

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:49.630
You abandoned us long ago; what right do you
have?

00:11:49.630 --> 00:11:51.220
CHARACTER STARTS FIGHT WITH GARL

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:55.480
But good intentions do not make one immune
from spreading evil.

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:59.579
Instead, they simply heighten the tragedy.

00:11:59.579 --> 00:12:01.910
KILL GARL

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:04.250
Dearest Astraea…

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:07.390
I have failed you.

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:08.790
(music swells)

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:11.850
WALK UP TO ASTRAEA, INITIATE DIALOGUE

00:12:11.850 --> 00:12:12.850
You…

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:15.170
You killed him, didn't you?

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:19.579
Very Well, I can no longer resist you.

00:12:19.579 --> 00:12:21.790
Do as you like.

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:24.550
Take your precious Demon soul.

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:29.790
Astraea..defiled, and dressed in white - has
a soul that grants spells of death, relief,

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:31.610
and resurrection.

00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:38.880
She is, at once, the most impure demon of
all..but also closer to god than any saint

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:46.930
before her.

00:12:46.930 --> 00:13:23.030
So ask yourself, Slayer of Demons.

00:13:23.030 --> 00:14:45.660
Do 

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:49.110
the ends, justify the means?

